": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OXKlupoBl5QQ7kNvwHpU_yr&_nc_oc=AdpsMNzYtE6ln1kN7uidydcJ6-R6887ZuSYvnXL6z3vodvVaK8xmBjeDCr8_AMzrDvc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFOBnCkXfEWpN-SO6CdNs6TCAdk8XNRnAQuRobScrqp5A&oe=6A883F5B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pflFbdyEV64Q7kNvwHpmUBd&_nc_oc=AdqVkLG2PESVJPzWnuCzH-eKqtTJpzfsNiL-0yQ74PIGKDqA1Xt7AvjcmEG5dxzYwJw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHNqtNbL20B-gB7IDdu95avAJHxdIZIbicZRWMIsYMUkw&oe=6A882FA1"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=odJPKKlAHVwQ7kNvwGq253t&_nc_oc=AdponsnPE0cxf_cyVNDxr7HspeZTdqm7cmVTm1sO26Cwn1tbUCNhQScRZD0HPRn6AjU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEb4AmoViofYrB3thw0QMz5DvdnjF5j0B61I_RaHz6uSg&oe=6A881C6F"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1ysVkHjEHEQQ7kNvwGmXTY1&_nc_oc=AdoxEm3QK9p26HUYFcDLolQaxu-7T_YY08BFlDv8f26q-GEV2XOWk0eH5q73zlWbPCM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHCRukMpeixKHMfHUG25_5OC6_CeN7sNjE64rvXeKJACw&oe=6A881C12"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K9MaLND9BucQ7kNvwGw3gR8&_nc_oc=AdrJdljG2RxDgWq2U3-4DbYtWssDXsDXuqzfusFsDNTtj38sxMRezwE__OEVW49_NjY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGjr1eo21H3SVBBqYjeb6mx_U_EhMDD4BO-3HNTicA6_A&oe=6A8825BD"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a